    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Contents\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bThis is the sequel to the game &quot;Frog vs. Mural Girl&quot; that our circle created in the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a small frog and defeat the giant &quot;Mural Girl.&quot; It is a 3D platform action game that focuses on &quot;undressing&quot; situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is expected to take 5-10 minutes. Feel free to stream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010How to operate\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can control the game using either a keyboard or a gamepad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's probably easier to use a gamepad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls will be explained in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Precautions\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThis game is available in Japanese and English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThis game does not contain any depictions of genitals or sexual intercourse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbWhen Damage Free Mode is turned on, your life will not be reduced even if you receive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThere are no rewards for the &quot;Time Attack&quot; and &quot;Medal Collection&quot; elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThis game is a sequel to the game &quot;\u30ab\u30a8\u30ebvs\u58c1\u753b\u5a18&quot; that we created in the past. The original &quot;\u30ab\u30a8\u30ebvs\u58c1\u753b\u5a18&quot; can be played in the &quot;\u30ab\u30d7\u30ea\u30c3\u30c8\u7403\u30df\u30cb\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u30b3\u30ec\u30af\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
